	(text "Mode switches: back-to-back pairs, gates at +12 V_A. Both off at reset;\nthe controller breaks one before it makes the other.\nVIN: F2 and D6 take a reversed supply. VIN_OV goes high above 5.5 V\nand Q1 then holds the ampere switch open (it blocks up to 30 V),\nwhatever the controller asks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
